# Reading a Russian poem: Lermontov's «Парус»
subtitle: "A lonely sail in the blue mist: read, hear and understand Lermontov's «Парус», the poem every Russian knows from school."
tags: ["russian","lermontov","russian poetry","парус","russian reading"]
teaches: ["reading/poetry","reading/reading-literature"]
thumb: "band \"Read a Russian poem\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Reading Russian news: headlines, participles, verbal nouns","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/189-russian-news-headlines.cast"}

