    glossed p3 "Что ки́нул он в краю́ родно́м?.." say_voice b gloss ["","","","","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 stress none x 370 y 215 width 680 font_size 40 hidden true
    text e3 "What has it left in its native land?" #8f887c x 370 y 139 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed p4 "Игра́ют во́лны — ве́тер сви́щет," say_voice b gloss ["","","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 read_first true stress none x 370 y 650 width 680 font_size 40 hidden true
    text e4 "The waves play, the wind whistles," #8f887c x 370 y 574 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed p5 "И ма́чта гнётся и скрыпи́т..." say_voice b gloss ["","mast","","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 stress none x 370 y 505 width 680 font_size 40 hidden true
    text e5 "and the mast bends and creaks..." #8f887c x 370 y 429 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed p6 "Увы́! он сча́стия не и́щет," say_voice b gloss ["alas","","","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 stress none x 370 y 360 width 680 font_size 40 hidden true
    text e6 "Alas! It is not seeking happiness," #8f887c x 370 y 284 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed p7 "И не от сча́стия бежи́т!" say_voice b gloss ["","","","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 stress none x 370 y 215 width 680 font_size 40 hidden true
    text e7 "nor running from happiness!" #8f887c x 370 y 139 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed p8 "Под ним струя́ светле́й лазу́ри," say_voice b gloss ["","","a stream","","azure"] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 read_first true stress none x 370 y 650 width 680 font_size 40 hidden true
    text e8 "Below it, water brighter than the azure," #8f887c x 370 y 574 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed p9 "Над ним луч со́лнца золото́й..." say_voice b gloss ["","","","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 stress none x 370 y 505 width 680 font_size 40 hidden true
