    quiz "Lermontov's «Парус» ends with this line. What does it mean?" above q_last voice a
        right: Пра́вильно! As if in storms there were peace.
        wrong: Как бу́дто: as if. As if in storms there were peace.
        + as if in storms there were peace
        * because the storm is over
        * as if the sea were asleep

A: Тепе́рь вы. Three lines from the poem, three meanings.
    draw match

    ask "Match each line from «Парус» to its meaning." on match store m stage own
        right: Молоде́ц!
        wrong: Посмотри́те ещё раз.

    erase match

