A: Шесть вопро́сов. Послу́шайте.
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name

    ask "Tom and Masha talk about Lermontov's «Парус». What does the sail ask for? (бу́ря = a storm)" listen [{"voice":"a","who":"Tom","text":"Ма́ша, что про́сит па́рус?","gloss":"Masha, what does the sail ask for?"},{"voice":"b","who":"Ма́ша","text":"Он про́сит бу́ри.","gloss":"It asks for a storm."},{"voice":"a","who":"Tom","text":"Зна́чит, он и́щет сча́стья?","gloss":"So it's looking for happiness?"},{"voice":"b","who":"Ма́ша","text":"Нет, он сча́стья не и́щет.","gloss":"No, it isn't looking for happiness."},{"voice":"a","who":"Tom","text":"А что над ним?","gloss":"And what is above it?"},{"voice":"b","who":"Ма́ша","text":"Над ним со́лнце, а под ним мо́ре.","gloss":"Above it the sun, and below it the sea."}] options ["a storm","the sun","a quiet sea"] correct 1 test t1
        right: Он про́сит бу́ри.
        wrong: Он про́сит бу́ри: a storm.

    ask "In Lermontov's «Парус», is the sail looking for happiness?" listen same options ["no","yes","Masha doesn't know"] correct 1 test t1
        right: Нет, он сча́стья не и́щет.
        wrong: Нет, он сча́стья не и́щет: no.

    ask "In Lermontov's «Парус», what is above the sail?" listen same options ["the sun","the stars","a storm"] correct 1 test t1
        right: Над ним со́лнце.
        wrong: Над ним со́лнце: the sun.

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

