    '|a||Reading a Russian poem: Lermontov''s «Парус»':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3640
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||A lonely sail in the blue mist: read, hear and understand Lermontov''s «Парус», the poem every Russian knows from school.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:psyc9e'
    '|a||Can you read a real Russian poem? Коне́ц февраля́. Ве́чер, моро́з.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6160
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Сего́дня Ма́ша пока́зывает мне ма́ленькую карти́ну из музе́я. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1xt4l3m'
    '|a||Ма́ша, что э́то за карти́на?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1qklj9k'
    '|b||Мо́ре, не́бо и па́рус. Я вспо́мнила стихи́ Ле́рмонтова.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5680
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Ле́рмонтова? Поэ́та?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2240
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Да. Э́то стихотворе́ние все зна́ют со шко́лы. И есть пе́сня.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4960
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Прочита́й мне его́!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1320
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Хорошо́. Но снача́ла посмотри́ на не́бо: каки́е звёзды!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6840
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Masha shows Tom a small picture. What is in it? (па́рус = a sail)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6280
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Мо́ре, не́бо и па́рус.':
