      ms: 2240
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Who knows Lermontov''s poem, and from when?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3760
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Все зна́ют со шко́лы.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1920
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||What does Tom ask Masha to do?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2520
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Но́вые слова́. Стихи́: poetry, verse. Стихотворе́ние: one poem. Поэ́т: a poet.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9360
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Пе́сня: a song. Не́бо: the sky. Звезда́, звёзды: a star, stars.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:rua57q'
    '|a||Михаи́л Ле́рмонтов написа́л «Па́рус» в ты́сяча восемьсо́т три́дцать второ́м году́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:og4k65'
    '|a||Ему́ бы́ло семна́дцать лет. Two forms are old: одино́кой is одино́кий today, скрыпи́т is скрипи́т.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:109j8yb'
    '|a||Прочита́йте са́ми. Пото́м чита́ет Ма́ша.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:29xcqu'
    '|b||Беле́ет па́рус одино́кой':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2440
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:b8jabw'
    '|b||В тума́не мо́ря голубо́м!..':
