      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1op5nup'
    '|b||Игра́ют во́лны — ве́тер сви́щет,':
