      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1wc01lw'
    '|a||Сча́стия: an older, poetic сча́стья. The sail is not looking for happiness.':
