      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:pwtymb'
    '|b||Под ним струя́ светле́й лазу́ри,':
